<title>HONG KONG: Bank of China head office to set US$200 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank of China head office to set US$200 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of China Beijing Head Office has mandated Daiwa Securties Hong Kong to lead manage a senior unsubordinated US$200 million floating rate note issue, bankers said Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue has a final maturity of five years and will be launched in bond-style. The issue will be listed in Singapore, bankers said.</p>
<p>Pricing details are not available yet.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039  http://www.hk97.com</p>
